WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.208
When you're different,

00:00:01.208 --> 00:00:03.516
you have to work 
at belonging.

00:00:03.516 --> 00:00:05.633
Everybody wants 
 to feel valued

00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:06.487
and accepted,

00:00:06.487 --> 00:00:08.889
and we think it should 
happen spontaneously,

00:00:08.889 --> 00:00:10.282
but it doesn't.

00:00:10.282 --> 00:00:12.100
Sometimes, 
society tells us,

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.311
and we tell ourselves,
we don't fit the mold.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.507
Take a piece of paper,

00:00:17.507 --> 00:00:19.840
and write down what
makes you different,

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.596
and I want you to 
celebrate it

00:00:21.596 --> 00:00:23.272
today and every day,

00:00:23.272 --> 00:00:25.038
shout it from 
the rooftops.

00:00:25.038 --> 00:00:26.518
What makes 
me different

00:00:26.518 --> 00:00:28.939
is what has made 
me stand out

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:30.368
and be successful.

00:00:30.368 --> 00:00:33.321
I also encourage you to 
be curious and ask,

00:00:33.321 --> 00:00:35.932
"What is on other people's 
pieces of paper?"

00:00:35.932 --> 00:00:38.147
"What makes them 
different?"

00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:40.970
Let's celebrate those
 imperfections

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:42.544
that make us special.

00:00:42.544 --> 00:00:44.177
I hope that it 
teaches you

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:47.562
that nobody has a claim 
on the word "normal."

00:00:47.562 --> 00:00:49.447
We are all different.

00:00:49.447 --> 00:00:52.201
We are all quirky, 
and unique,

00:00:52.201 --> 00:00:54.338
and that is what 
makes us

00:00:54.338 --> 00:00:56.347
wonderfully human.

